{"articleNo":"572616","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=572616&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2026-2학기 수강지도 상담 여부 확인 경로 안내","writer":"교무과","writeDate":"2026.08.04","hit":"7310","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">수강지도 상담 여부를 확인할 수 있는 메뉴를 안내하오니&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">상담 미완료 학생들은 </span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">기간</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"> 내 반드시 수강지도 상담 완료 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 18pt;\">기</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 18pt;\">간 내 수강지도상담</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(70, 115, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 18pt;\"> 미완료 시 수강꾸러미 삭제 조치되며, 정식수강신청 기간에 수강신청 불가</span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b>&nbsp;(다만, 상담기간이 지났더라도 수강지도상담을 받아야 수강신청 가능)</b></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -44.8px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">※ 2026-2학기 학적변동자(복학생, 재입학생) 및 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -44.8px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">졸업유예생</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -33.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">은 수강지도 상담이 원칙이지만, 수강신청 및 수강꾸러미 기간을 고려하여 수강지도 미실시하더라도&nbsp;</span></b></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -33.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;수강신청 제한하지 않음</span></b></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -33.6pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">* </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">상담기간:</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;7</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt;\">.27.(월) 09:00 ~ 8.5.(수) 24:00&nbsp;</span></b></p><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">확인경로 : 원킷(Onekit) -&gt; 통합정보시스템 -&gt; 학사행정 -&gt; </span></span></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 18pt;\">수업 -&gt; 수강꾸러미확인서</span></b></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmDYHo0hBAVA5gdwBYDECaBJeB1ARQDkAhWABQC10SAPSgOgAcA7RIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" alt=\"[수업]\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t2026-1학기 수강지도 상담 여부 확인 경로 안내\" style=\"margin: 0px auto 1rem; display: block; max-width: 100%; clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
